    "authored_date": "2026-07-18",
    "deviation_notes": "The 'ground-lying weapons ARE the summon ammunition; the loot drop-stream is the resource pool' is the kit's signature identity and has no engine lane — engine proxies draw from mana/corpses, not consumed ground-item entities. Mapped as a standard transient poison-proxy swarm (PROXY_FISSION) which captures the combat feel but LOSES the loot-becomes-ammo resource-substrate. A player of the original would miss that their army's size and cadence were fed by what dropped on the floor. Docket candidate filed.",
